0..78 Comment "// Addition on the naturals in each spelling an arm admits: a `return` after a"
79..148 Comment "// `run`, the same with both elided, the recursive call nested in the"
149..224 Comment "// constructor it returns (the base\'s `plus`), and a `run` written inside a"
225..299 Comment "// constructor\'s field. Each spelling runs to the same value. A structural"
300..373 Comment "// recursive call stands one stage below the term it was read from (Abel,"
374..448 Comment "// _Termination checking with types_, doi:10.1051/ita:2004015). The lists\'"
449..518 Comment "// folds are `recursive-lists.gandr` and `recursive-nat-lists.gandr`."
520..591 Comment "// The naturals, their addition with the recursive call nested, and the"
592..618 Comment "// numerals two and three."
